<p>You are trained in an agile, mobile fighting technique combining sling and shield. This allows shields to be equipped, using Dexterity instead of Strength as a requirement.</p><p>While you have a shield equip and your Block talent is not on cooldown, you have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 25%, 32%, 39%, 45%</acronym> chance to deflect any incoming damage, reducing it by 50% of your shield’s block value.</p>